Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.82,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　源源不绝的热情{\fad(500,00)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.91,0:00:11.91,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着怦然心动的未来  伸出双手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:18.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够放出光芒　IT'S WONDERLAND
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:24.04,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,未来那无法预测的黑夜  震撼着你的心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:31.84,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无法相信任何东西  你充耳不闻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.54,0:00:39.46,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与你相遇的瞬间  我找到了真正的归宿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:48.13,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不自觉的温柔呈现在面前  把我们唤醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.57,0:00:55.19,OP2,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,I WANT TO CHANGE THE WORLD　不会再迷茫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.19,0:01:04.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要构筑起跟你在一起的未来  就能飞向任何地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:10.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,CHANGE MY MIND　源源不绝的热情
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.36,0:01:15.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向着未知的明天  张开双翼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.15,0:01:21.93,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能够展翅飞翔　IT'S WONDERLAND{\fad(0000,480)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.17,0:22:17.67,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们 在生命的旅程中{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:23.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}渐渐地 失去所有
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.18,0:22:29.56,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我仍坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:36.70,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.57,0:22:46.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如今在那深深的丛林中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.08,0:22:52.58,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也一定埋藏着 被丢弃的心
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:59.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}若能把握时光的轮回
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.08,0:23:05.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许 能再次飞翔{\fad(0,1050)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.73,0:23:14.00,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们将彷徨着
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.53,0:23:20.44,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}生存下去 直到永远
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:25.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}仍然坚信着 追逐着光明
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.41,0:23:32.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在与你 一同出发{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.33,0:01:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了！从森林那边来了！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.33,0:01:44.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.70,0:02:21.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是四魂碎片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.38,0:02:25.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让蜈蚣突然变得凶暴的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.79,0:02:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.12,0:02:41.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是有什么事情尽管叫我就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.23,0:02:43.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师大人 谢礼…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 我收下这个就好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.07,0:02:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.73,0:02:50.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来就是从我们村里出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.70,0:02:55.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 珊瑚登场！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.44,0:03:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天上有好多星星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.81,0:03:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些星星的数量和四魂碎片的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.85,0:03:07.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪个比较多呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.69,0:03:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来前面还有很长一段路要走啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.52,0:03:13.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:16.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落那混蛋也跟我们一样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.50,0:03:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在收集着四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细想一想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.40,0:03:23.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样还可以省下不少工夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.20,0:03:26.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要让那家伙去收集 然后我们一拼抢过来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个计划不错吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.77,0:03:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:32.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到的四魂碎片越多
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.94,0:03:35.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落就会变得更强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.81,0:03:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到那时候就太迟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.45,0:03:42.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们得抢先收集更多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.02,0:03:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我这种小孩子都懂的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.02,0:03:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就不懂呢？真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:51.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的脑子到底有多蠢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:53.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么？小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.63,0:03:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你收集到所有碎片以后有什么打算？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.40,0:04:00.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还用问嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.71,0:04:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要变成真正的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊 原来是这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.85,0:04:09.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为不够强就什么都做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算遇到看不顺眼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.48,0:04:13.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不够人家强的话就完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:16.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你藉助四魂之玉的力量变成完全的妖怪以后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.93,0:04:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还能保持自我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:25.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.36,0:04:31.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见过有谁用四魂碎片的力量做好事的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直有个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.01,0:04:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到四魂之玉之力的人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:41.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,与此同时 也会失去心智
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不记得自己说过要变成好妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.09,0:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 你想要保护戈薇小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.33,0:04:56.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你需要力量
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你利用四魂之玉变成妖怪之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.53,0:05:06.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能就会把戈薇小姐和七宝吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:09.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连我都要吃？就不吃弥勒吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.04,0:05:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会一早逃走的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.71,0:05:14.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.61,0:05:17.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在为止跟四魂之玉扯上关系的妖怪们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.62,0:05:19.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原本就都不是好东西
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.05,0:05:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是因为那样罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.12,0:05:24.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我…不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.43,0:05:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.36,0:05:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.50,0:05:34.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女人把四魂碎片拿走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:35.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候拿走的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.80,0:05:37.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！快说！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.64,0:05:38.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有妖怪了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去找除妖师啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.21,0:05:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是大蜈蚣啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.31,0:05:45.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我哪里像了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说除妖师？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:53.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来还有人以除妖为职业啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.95,0:05:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:58.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个除妖师在收集四魂之玉的碎片吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 她还说那个叫什么的玉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.59,0:06:04.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是从她的村子流落出去的东西呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.96,0:06:05.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.03,0:06:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你知道这件事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.04,0:06:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.74,0:06:15.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道有四魂之玉的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.61,0:06:18.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它已经由桔梗在守护着了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:21.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉是怎么来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:23.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从哪来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.68,0:06:25.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有想过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.43,0:06:35.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚 你回来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.19,0:06:36.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎物是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大蜈蚣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我带回来一些脚和皮
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.43,0:06:44.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以用来制作盔甲吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.31,0:06:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖哦 乖哦 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.81,0:06:50.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有没有做好孩子啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.58,0:06:53.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来啦 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.01,0:06:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我回来了 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.01,0:06:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲他…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.58,0:07:00.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,首领叫你过去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:04.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗 你得到四魂碎片了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.16,0:07:05.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.96,0:07:07.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.79,0:07:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.33,0:07:14.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样能镇住碎片的邪气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.03,0:07:16.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.40,0:07:20.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概50年前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.41,0:07:22.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把玉交给一位灵力高强的巫女保管
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.91,0:07:25.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并由她净化着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.31,0:07:27.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到那位大人最后…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.11,0:07:30.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是在争抢玉的战斗中去世了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.62,0:07:34.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.19,0:07:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是在找到能够净化玉的灵力高强的人之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.99,0:07:38.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把碎片收集到村里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.42,0:07:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并小心守护了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:43.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,净化玉的灵力…吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:47.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你休息一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.07,0:07:49.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就又有工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.84,0:07:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你也要做好准备哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.91,0:07:55.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.11,0:07:57.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经11岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.31,0:07:59.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该参加实战了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:04.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:10.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪真的会喷火喷毒的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.36,0:08:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候会哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.33,0:08:17.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 你害怕吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:19.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我才没害怕呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.07,0:08:22.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.47,0:08:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要收拾的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是一些大蛇和大蜘蛛罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.77,0:08:28.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父亲不是说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:29.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最可怕的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是伪装成人类的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.34,0:08:36.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种妖怪要是得到四魂之玉就麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.12,0:08:43.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 你们来得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.29,0:08:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.22,0:08:46.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只大蜘蛛每晚都会来袭击城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.89,0:08:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城中已经有数人被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有办法收拾它吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.86,0:08:54.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 请交给我们处理
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.13,0:08:58.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从村里挑选了几个高手来除妖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你说的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不就是像女人一样的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连小孩子都有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:09.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.38,0:09:11.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是在下的女儿和儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们村是数一数二的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚就请您见识他们的身手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.56,0:09:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到没？要加油哦 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.43,0:09:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,父…父亲这个大骗子…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.84,0:09:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公 它来了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.90,0:09:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师 就是那个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.57,0:09:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:09:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有妖怪出来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.06,0:10:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主的病之所以久治不愈
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.07,0:10:05.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定是因为妖怪的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主公已经找来了除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.07,0:10:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这场喧闹也只到今夜为止了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.34,0:10:15.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后只需期待少主您早日康复了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.45,0:10:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除妖师？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.08,0:10:20.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它围起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.46,0:10:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:34.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.57,0:10:43.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 压制住它了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.88,0:10:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:59.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:02.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为珊瑚是村里最好的高手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.03,0:11:06.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下子就把那个大蜘蛛给…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.03,0:11:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 最后一击
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.23,0:11:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它脑袋打烂！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:11.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…我也来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.28,0:11:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过是块头大了点 没什么了不起嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.55,0:11:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在太简单了…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只蜘蛛的妖气也很弱…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:48.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:55.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 为什么要把父亲他们…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.55,0:12:01.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.96,0:12:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…连我都不认识了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 除妖师！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底在干什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随他们去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.23,0:12:18.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是有趣的余兴节目
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.44,0:12:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了？琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,丝…是蜘蛛丝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.36,0:12:40.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:46.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你干的好事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.50,0:12:47.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这对姐弟都发疯了 杀了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.24,0:12:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.04,0:12:57.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.66,0:13:18.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:19.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:21.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.77,0:13:28.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.74,0:13:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快射下一箭 对准发疯的两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.04,0:13:34.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥…琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.41,0:13:40.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐…我好怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.38,0:13:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别怕…有我在…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.92,0:13:50.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两姐弟和好了啊 可喜可贺可喜…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主…主公…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:59.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主 主公他到底怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.90,0:14:02.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.17,0:14:03.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们看清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.05,0:14:09.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.55,0:14:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.55,0:14:19.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就觉得父亲不太对劲
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:21.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是被妖怪附身了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.69,0:14:24.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可怜了那些除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.23,0:14:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们埋到庭院一角去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.21,0:14:35.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真伤脑筋啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.11,0:14:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然没一个人知道除妖师的村落在哪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只知道在山里面啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.75,0:14:44.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吵死了 总之去找就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你要去除妖师的村子抢四魂碎片吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:50.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那当然啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.32,0:14:53.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别反而被除掉了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.26,0:14:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊 人家似乎是专业高手诶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.63,0:14:58.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过 我也很想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.03,0:15:01.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉为何会出现
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.77,0:15:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还说四魂之玉本来就出自他们的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.00,0:15:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉也一定很想知道原因吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事…真是让人讨厌的风
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.52,0:15:20.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么正在接近我们
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.48,0:15:22.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且数量很多
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是一大群妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.07,0:15:35.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好强的妖气…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:38.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.54,0:15:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是一般的妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.30,0:15:43.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 诡异得让人恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.81,0:15:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杀气
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.04,0:15:46.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们想去攻击什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.28,0:15:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.05,0:15:52.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那对除妖师姐弟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.78,0:15:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细看看还很小啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.65,0:15:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可怜啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.56,0:16:03.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.93,0:16:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么…能死…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:17.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,女除妖师？你还活着啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.11,0:16:55.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们多年来对除妖师的怨恨
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.65,0:16:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎都发泄完了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.62,0:17:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好心告诉你们这个山寨的除妖师都出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.59,0:17:10.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们居然连我都想攻击吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.41,0:17:32.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知好歹的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:45.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.32,0:17:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山寨？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.36,0:17:48.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来那些妖怪的目标…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.50,0:17:49.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这里！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.27,0:17:49.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.18,0:18:08.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.25,0:18:10.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们跟妖怪战斗过了吗…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:13.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对没错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座山寨
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.46,0:18:17.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们一直在找的除妖师的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了？戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.97,0:18:24.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里没有四魂碎片的气息呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.44,0:18:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全被抢走了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.20,0:18:27.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是这样吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:30.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上去追的话说不定能追上
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.44,0:18:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先把这些村民埋葬了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.38,0:18:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.71,0:18:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像有什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:49.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有妖怪活着吗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.56,0:18:54.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…那个声音是犬夜叉少爷
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.30,0:18:56.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它会说话？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.67,0:18:57.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安静下来 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:00.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人不是你的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.74,0:19:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可爱…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.45,0:19:11.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好想念您
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.82,0:19:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.08,0:19:16.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会在这种地方…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.52,0:19:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们认识啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.82,0:19:20.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是犬夜叉的家臣 算是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:26.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 这里是除妖师隐居的村落
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个村子里的人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.07,0:19:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎世世代代都是除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:35.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪那些妖怪会这么怨恨他们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.84,0:19:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是偏偏趁这个时候来袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村里的高手都被召入城中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.05,0:19:46.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚好是村子的防御最薄弱的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.58,0:19:48.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的心里面一直觉得很不安
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.82,0:19:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被召入城中的人们没事吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.59,0:19:53.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少还有你一个人活了下来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.83,0:19:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 除妖师
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么不回答少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爷爷 算了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.80,0:20:05.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫做珊瑚对不对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:07.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的父亲 还有弟弟…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和同伴都…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.04,0:20:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？为什么会发生这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.35,0:20:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少主
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.25,0:20:21.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.10,0:20:22.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我听从您的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.59,0:20:28.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快马加鞭 赶到了除妖师的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.76,0:20:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到村子里的人都被杀死了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.07,0:20:39.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是遗憾啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:44.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来还想向村里人打听许多事情的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.38,0:20:46.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.34,0:20:47.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该知道些什么吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:51.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是指四魂之玉的事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:52.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冥加爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.02,0:20:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道你是在这里调查玉的事情吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.12,0:20:59.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很早以前就十分在意了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.52,0:21:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉到底是什么东西呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.53,0:21:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为跟玉扯上关系的人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.63,0:21:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后都会遭遇不幸
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追踪着四魂之玉的传闻
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.47,0:21:12.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后就来到了这个村庄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.04,0:21:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过有一件事我很在意
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.71,0:21:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,途中一直都能看到一个白狒狒的身影出没
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.95,0:21:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白狒狒！？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.33,0:21:22.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.45,0:21:27.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是奈落…他就在这附近…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.28,0:21:28.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把详细情况告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:31.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在除妖师的村落看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:34.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看到了横尸遍野的村民
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.73,0:21:36.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和袭击村子的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.69,0:21:39.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的名字叫犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.73,0:21:42.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉企图利用四魂之玉的妖力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.17,0:21:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成完全的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.40,0:21:50.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能他认为能在除妖师的村落得到四魂之玉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.94,0:21:53.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才会袭击那个村子的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.98,0:21:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:21:59.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我的武器…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞来骨还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.59,0:22:03.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个袭击村子的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.99,0:22:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去杀了那个叫犬夜叉的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.22,0:23:51.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚听说袭击自己村子的是犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.73,0:23:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用尽最后的力量向犬夜叉袭来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.20,0:23:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的身体根本不能再战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:24:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,挥舞著名叫飞来骨的回力标的珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.53,0:24:02.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,背上奇怪地闪烁着四魂碎片的光
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.04,0:24:05.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切又是那家伙的诡计
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.47,0:24:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对变身后的奈落 犬夜叉用铁碎牙发起攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.28,0:24:12.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下回 犬夜叉 摧毁奈落的诡计！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.78,0:24:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.78,0:24:18.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉宝典
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.43,0:24:25.48,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(278,291)}女除妖师 被奈落设计灭族
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.43,0:24:25.48,KEYPOINT,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(291,418)}使用名叫飞来骨的巨大回力标
